A plain text is a page node with an ID, so the next element skips that ID.
-- input.html --
<body><div>Plain text<p>After</p></div></body>
-- want.html --
<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title></title>
<link rel="canonical" href="http://example.com/"/></head>
<body data-id="0"><div data-id="1">Plain text<p data-id="3">After</p></div></body></html>
